	  CSS, GtkVBox/GtkHBox -> GtkBox, stock icons -> icon names,
	  GtkStyle/GdkBitmap/GTK_WIDGET_* and direct struct access removed
	* Remove dynamic exception specifications and the 'register' keyword
	  so the sources build with current C++ compilers
	* configure.ac, gaiksaurus-1.0.pc.in: require gtk+-3.0
	* gaiksaurus: add -t/--tray option (system tray icon via GtkStatusIcon), -m/--minimized; add gaiksaurus(1) man page
	* AiksaurusGTK: keep the dialog (results, history) when it is closed and
	  shown again; show the initial message only for a newly created window

